C       AUTOCODER TOOL - MAIN ENTRY POINT
*       THIS FILE CONTAINS THE CORE LOGIC FOR THE AUTOCODER TOOL
*       BUILT STRICTLY IN AUTOCODER LANGUAGE

*       DEFINE STORAGE AND CONTROL BLOCKS
        DC    0A,500A           * MAX STORAGE SIZE
        DS    0H                * HEAD POINTER

*       MAIN PROGRAM ENTRY
MAIN    EQU   *                 * ENTRY POINT
        LD    A,START         * LOAD START ADDRESS
        JMP   EXECUTE         * JUMP TO EXECUTOR

*       EXECUTION LOOP
EXECUTE DC    0A,0A           * INITIALIZATION
        LDA   INPUT         * READ INPUT
        JZ    DONE          * EXIT IF END OF INPUT
        CAL   PROCESS       * PROCESS RECORD
        JMP   EXECUTE       * CONTINUE LOOP

DONE    LDA   OUTPUT        * OUTPUT RESULTS
        STOP                * HALT SYSTEM

*       PROCESSOR ROUTINE
PROCESS STA   TEMP          * STORE CURRENT DATA
        CAL   TRANSFORM     * APPLY TRANSFORMATIONS
        STA   RESULT        * STORE RESULT
        LDA   RESULT        * LOAD FOR OUTPUT
        RTS                 * RETURN TO CALLER

*       HELPER SUBROUTINES
TRANSFORM LDA TEMP          * LOAD DATA
        ADD   PARM          * ADD PARAMETER
        STA TEMP          * STORE BACK
        RTS                 * RETURN

*       DATA SEGMENTS
INPUT   DS    0A            * INPUT BUFFER
OUTPUT  DS    0A            * OUTPUT BUFFER
TEMP    DS    0A            * TEMPORARY STORAGE
RESULT  DS    0A            * RESULT STORAGE
PARAM   DC    10A           * DEFAULT PARAMETER
        END   MAIN          * END OF PROGRAM
